simulation S { duration 1 h }
intersection A at (0 m, 0 m)
intersection B at 100 m east of A
intersection C at 100 m east of B
road CórdobaOeste from A to B
metric Completados = count() on arrival label "Vehículos que completaron su ruta"
metric ViajePromedio = average(trip.travel_time) on arrival
metric PicoOeste = maximum(occupancy(CórdobaOeste)) on tick
